\section{Shared test fixtures}

Several test modules need the same environment: a temporary directory
with a dummy Python file and a Git identity that works even in CI
(where no global Git config exists).
Rather than duplicating this fixture in every test file, we define it
once in a shared [[conftest.py]] that pytest discovers automatically.

<<[[conftest.py]]>>=
"""Shared test fixtures for learnlog.

Provides the ``workdir`` fixture used by all learnlog test modules.
"""
